# Test requests: start the API (Ctrl+F5 in Visual Studio, IIS Express), then click "Send request" above a request.
# Or use the test page https://localhost:44321/ or Swagger https://localhost:44321/swagger.
# On IIS, change @host to the site's address (e.g. http://server/CcmsApi).
# OCR takes ~30-45 s per page, so the uploads can take a few minutes.

@host = https://localhost:44321

### Is it working? (API, OCR server and LLM server)
GET {{host}}/health

### OCR a document and run the task -> the fields
# Change the path after "<" to a real document. Add more "files" parts to read several files as one document.
POST {{host}}/api/documents/process
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=DocumentBoundary

--DocumentBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="document.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< C:\path\to\document.pdf
--DocumentBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="includeText"

true
--DocumentBoundary--
